            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE akuŵeceta kuti, “Ndaŵi jikwisa jitinjapa cilango ŵandu wosope, ŵawumbale, ŵali ŵangasamala m'mitima mwawo. Tinjapa cilango ŵandu ŵa ku Iguputo, ku Yuda, Ku Edomu, ku Amoni, ku Mowabu, ni ŵandu ŵa ku cipululu ŵakusamyola ca mumbali mwa mitwe jawo, mitundu josopeji jili jangawumbala, nambo soni nganasunga yicikwimilila cilanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.25+JER.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.25",
              "JER.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Jwalijose jwa ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵa pangali jwasunjile cilanga cangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.25+JER.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.25",
              "JER.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
